#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Keeping a Ditana system healthy — updating properly, repairing signature errors, recovering from a bad update, and where to report a bug."
msgstr "Mantegnair in sistem da Ditana en bun stadi – actualisar correctamain, reparar errurs da signatura, restaurar il sistem suenter in’actualisaziun problematica e nua annunziar in’errur."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Schliar problems"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/index.md
msgid ""
"Most problems on a rolling-release system come from one of three things: a "
"system that has not been updated in a while, a signature check that cannot "
"succeed because a keyring is out of date, or an update that changed "
"something you were relying on. These pages cover all three, and the last of "
"them explains where to report what is left."
msgstr ""
"La gronda part dals problems sin in sistem da rolling release deriva d’ina "
"da trais chaussas: in sistem che n’è betg vegnì actualisà dapi in tschert "
"temp, ina controlla da signatura che na po betg reussir perquai ch’in "
"portaclavs è antiquà, u in’actualisaziun che ha midà ina chaussa, sin la "
"quala Vus As basavas. Questas paginas tractan tut las trais chaussas, e "
"l’ultima pagina explitgescha nua ch’ins po annunziar quai che resta."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/index.md
msgid ""
"If you are stuck, the [Discord channel](https://discord.gg/RgcdumdE9J) is "
"the fastest place to ask."
msgstr ""
"Sche Vus na savais betg pli vinavant, è il [chanal da Discord](https://"
"discord.gg/RgcdumdE9J) il lieu il pli svelt per dumandar."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/index.md
msgid ""
"[Updating is not optional](/troubleshooting/updating/) – Why a rolling "
"release must be updated entirely, how to update Ditana on the desktop or in "
"a terminal, and what actions to take afterwards."
msgstr ""
"[L’actualisaziun n’è betg facultativa](/troubleshooting/updating/) – Pertge "
"ch’in rolling release sto vegnir actualisà cumplettamain, co actualisar "
"Ditana sin il desktop u en in terminal e tge mesiras prender suenter."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/index.md
msgid ""
"[\"invalid or corrupted package (PGP signature)\"](/troubleshooting/"
"signature-errors/) – What should be done when pacman refuses a package due "
"to its inability to validate the signature, and how to manually verify "
"Ditana's signing key yourself."
msgstr ""
"[«invalid or corrupted package (PGP signature)»](/troubleshooting/signature-"
"errors/) – Tge far, cura che pacman refusa in pachet perquai ch’el na po "
"betg verifitgar la signatura, e co verifitgar persunalmain e manualmain la "
"clav da signatura da Ditana."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/index.md
msgid ""
"[An update broke something](/troubleshooting/an-update-broke-something/) – "
"Four steps to discover what an update changed and to get a functioning "
"system back."
msgstr ""
"[In’actualisaziun ha donnegià insatge](/troubleshooting/an-update-broke-"
"something/) – Quatter pass per chattar tge ch’in’actualisaziun ha midà e per "
"avair puspè in sistem che funcziuna."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/index.md
msgid ""
"[Flatpak or Bubblejail stopped working after an update](/troubleshooting/"
"flatpak-and-bubblejail/) – How to restore Flatpak and Bubblejail on a "
"machine installed from the 0.9.3 medium."
msgstr ""
"[Flatpak u Bubblejail na funcziunan betg pli suenter in’actualisaziun](/"
"troubleshooting/flatpak-and-bubblejail/) – Co restaurar Flatpak e Bubblejail "
"sin ina maschina installada cun il medium da la versiun 0.9.3."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/index.md
msgid ""
"[A Chromium-based program aborts: \"The SUID sandbox helper binary was "
"found, but is not configured correctly\"](/troubleshooting/chromium-sandbox-"
"helper/) – Why Discord and other programs built on Chromium or Electron may "
"abort at start under Ditana's hardening, and how to fix it."
msgstr ""
"[In program sin basa da Chromium interrumpa: «The SUID sandbox helper binary "
"was found, but is not configured correctly»](/troubleshooting/chromium-"
"sandbox-helper/) – Pertge che Discord ed auters programs sin basa da "
"Chromium u Electron pon interrumper a l’aviar sut il rinforzament da Ditana, "
"e co schliar il problem."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/index.md
msgid ""
"[Reporting a bug](/troubleshooting/reporting-a-bug/) – Which of Ditana's "
"repositories a problem belongs in, and what a useful report contains."
msgstr ""
"[Annunziar in’errur](/troubleshooting/reporting-a-bug/) – En tge repositori "
"da Ditana ch’in problem tutga e tge ch’in rapport nizzaivel cuntegna."
